(416368, 37377, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with a powerful message, I like it! I like the black and white with the flag colored also, very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with a powerful message, I like it! I like the black and white with the flag colored also, very nice.', '2003-09-12 01:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(416369, 37377, 92, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing. This is so very well thought out and done. My first 10 after many votes ! Good luck !</td>', 'Absolutely amazing. This is so very well thought out and done. My first 10 after many votes ! Good luck !', '2003-09-12 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
