(416375, 37332, 10263, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation. The subject isn''t of great interest to me but it is a nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation. The subject isn''t of great interest to me but it is a nice composition.', '2003-09-12 01:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
