(416413, 37377, 10263, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked a different angle on this better. The idea is great :)</td>', 'I think I would have liked a different angle on this better. The idea is great :)', '2003-09-12 01:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(416414, 37376, 10414, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this the truth......was this a stranger, or do you know this person??  9</td>', 'Isn''t this the truth......was this a stranger, or do you know this person??  9', '2003-09-12 01:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(416415, 37399, 10084, '<td valign="top">Really good composition. The front gravestone really brings your eyes to it. The others being in pretty good focus makes your eyes wonder around the scene. Nice. All the shadows and reflections in the grass really brings them to life. The blue sky and the clouds really add a beautiful depth of field.</td>', 'Really good composition. The front gravestone really brings your eyes to it. The others being in pretty good focus makes your eyes wonder around the scene. Nice. All the shadows and reflections in the grass really brings them to life. The blue sky and the clouds really add a beautiful depth of field.', '2003-09-12 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(416416, 37400, 10263, '<td valign="top">This photo is gorgeous. Not sure I can relate the drop of water to the tears as the title states, but that doesn''t take away from the beautiful photo and great composition and colors.</td>', 'This photo is gorgeous. Not sure I can relate the drop of water to the tears as the title states, but that doesn''t take away from the beautiful photo and great composition and colors.', '2003-09-12 01:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(416417, 37427, 10084, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the shot really brings it alive. You can almost feel the texture of the monument. I think with out the reflection the piece would have been very difficult to see.</td>', 'The reflection of the shot really brings it alive. You can almost feel the texture of the monument. I think with out the reflection the piece would have been very difficult to see.', '2003-09-12 01:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(416419, 37348, 10084, '<td valign="top">The frame takes away from the picture. Wished that there was more light. The words are very difficult to see. The flames are giving out some nice halos and they have a really nice color.</td>', 'The frame takes away from the picture. Wished that there was more light. The words are very difficult to see. The flames are giving out some nice halos and they have a really nice color.', '2003-09-12 01:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(416420, 37358, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, BEAUTIFUL place!!!!  Awesome picture.....brings back some memories...</td>', 'Beautiful, BEAUTIFUL place!!!!  Awesome picture.....brings back some memories...', '2003-09-12 01:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(416421, 37408, 10084, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition. Love the colors. It really gives interest to the piece. All of the colors combine really gives the picture some depth of field. Flowers are front. Green is the mid. The gray of the building is mid/back. The sky is the background. All of this combine to bring the flag out of the picture. Same for the flowers.</td>', 'Really nice composition. Love the colors. It really gives interest to the piece. All of the colors combine really gives the picture some depth of field. Flowers are front. Green is the mid. The gray of the building is mid/back. The sky is the background. All of this combine to bring the flag out of the picture. Same for the flowers.', '2003-09-12 01:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(416424, 37397, 6804, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this!<br/> <br/>I think of it as "Freedom of Expression"<br/>The bright light at the bottom is just a bit harsh.<br/>A bold entry for this challenge. I''ll be watching to see how it does.<br/></td>', 'I absolutely love this! I think of it as "Freedom of Expression"The bright light at the bottom is just a bit harsh.A bold entry for this challenge. I''ll be watching to see how it does.', '2003-09-12 02:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(416425, 37441, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Keeping the eye kind of blurry works. It gives the focus in on the flag. This is a very hypnotic.<br/> <br/>Love the colors of the flag you were able to include. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Keeping the eye kind of blurry works. It gives the focus in on the flag. This is a very hypnotic. Love the colors of the flag you were able to include. Wonderful shot.', '2003-09-12 02:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(416428, 37396, 10084, '<td valign="top">The black area on the lower left and top left is distracting. Your eyes automatic focus in on these areas. Lot''s of noise in the picture. Try turning down the ISO.<br/>It''s kind of difficult to see but looks like the World Trade Towers on the paper. Very interesting.</td>', 'The black area on the lower left and top left is distracting. Your eyes automatic focus in on these areas. Lot''s of noise in the picture. Try turning down the ISO.It''s kind of difficult to see but looks like the World Trade Towers on the paper. Very interesting.', '2003-09-12 02:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(416432, 37342, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The tower is really competing with the flag. What are we suppose to focus in on. Tower or Flag. The picture seem to have a yellow hue. Using a polarising filter may help.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The tower is really competing with the flag. What are we suppose to focus in on. Tower or Flag. The picture seem to have a yellow hue. Using a polarising filter may help.', '2003-09-12 02:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(416435, 37450, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful interpretation of the challenge. I think this one is going to be a winner.</td>', 'This is a wonderful interpretation of the challenge. I think this one is going to be a winner.', '2003-09-12 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(416436, 37454, 10084, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting idea. I like it. The angle you used makes the piece very interesting. You can still make out what it is because of the great reflections and shadows you were able to capture.</td>', 'This is a very interesting idea. I like it. The angle you used makes the piece very interesting. You can still make out what it is because of the great reflections and shadows you were able to capture.', '2003-09-12 02:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(416438, 37350, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the sentiment here, but the horizon is quite skewed and the blue object is distracting. Very good capture though.</td>', 'Like the sentiment here, but the horizon is quite skewed and the blue object is distracting. Very good capture though.', '2003-09-12 02:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(416439, 37432, 10084, '<td valign="top">Funny. The low contrast color of everything except the dog really brings your eyes to it. The way you have the door opened gives the escape more prominence. I like that you chose to get close to the level of the dog.</td>', 'Funny. The low contrast color of everything except the dog really brings your eyes to it. The way you have the door opened gives the escape more prominence. I like that you chose to get close to the level of the dog.', '2003-09-12 02:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(416440, 37428, 6804, '<td valign="top">Great work!<br/>I''m sure you''ll get beat up a little for the heavy manipulation. I''m happy to see the artist behind the camera in this shot. I''d love to see a little more of this type of expression on DPC, but all too many here are only seeking the technical aspects of photography when they vote.  High Marks from this left wing voter.</td>', 'Great work!I''m sure you''ll get beat up a little for the heavy manipulation. I''m happy to see the artist behind the camera in this shot. I''d love to see a little more of this type of expression on DPC, but all too many here are only seeking the technical aspects of photography when they vote.  High Marks from this left wing voter.', '2003-09-12 02:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(416441, 37342, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is great. I love the parallel lines. Colors are warm and rich. 8</td>', 'This is great. I love the parallel lines. Colors are warm and rich. 8', '2003-09-12 02:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(416445, 37347, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite shot here. The spirit of freedom is well represented and allows us to project our own thoughts on freedom without a literal reference. Good lighting and composition.</td>', 'This is my favourite shot here. The spirit of freedom is well represented and allows us to project our own thoughts on freedom without a literal reference. Good lighting and composition.', '2003-09-12 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(416446, 37374, 10084, '<td valign="top">The Hulk drives a Honda/Acura? Interesting picture. Focusing gives a ok depth of field. Makes the steering wheel a certain distance from the speedometer.</td>', 'The Hulk drives a Honda/Acura? Interesting picture. Focusing gives a ok depth of field. Makes the steering wheel a certain distance from the speedometer.', '2003-09-12 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(416447, 37423, 6804, '<td valign="top">OH YEA!<br/>A relative of Jimmy Hendrix?<br/>I have seen some great work in this challenge, from the artistic more so than technical side of photography. To me it''s refreshing to see. <br/>This is right up there with the best. <br/>Awesome Work!     "Freedom of Expression" 10</td>', 'OH YEA!A relative of Jimmy Hendrix?I have seen some great work in this challenge, from the artistic more so than technical side of photography. To me it''s refreshing to see. This is right up there with the best. Awesome Work!     "Freedom of Expression" 10', '2003-09-12 02:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(416448, 37403, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you used for the photo. Gives it a lot of interest. You can see the indention of the inscriptions in the monument. I wish that the contrast was tweaked a bit more to really bring this out. You could really bring out the shadows of the inscriptions and they would really pop out of the picture.</td>', 'I like the angle you used for the photo. Gives it a lot of interest. You can see the indention of the inscriptions in the monument. I wish that the contrast was tweaked a bit more to really bring this out. You could really bring out the shadows of the inscriptions and they would really pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-12 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(416449, 37358, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sentimental but... we could be German territory now if weren''t for those who fought and died in WWII. I find myself feeling very grateful quite often. I love the stark flag against such a rural backdrop. I really do think that our flag is the smartest in the world!</td>', 'I''m really not sentimental but... we could be German territory now if weren''t for those who fought and died in WWII. I find myself feeling very grateful quite often. I love the stark flag against such a rural backdrop. I really do think that our flag is the smartest in the world!', '2003-09-12 02:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(416450, 37332, 6804, '<td valign="top">I am so pleased to see some folks taking a chance in this challenge with some great artistic twists.<br/> <br/>Another - Freedom of Expression <br/>I love the black/white.<br/>I think without the title it''s kinda far out there. But I like it.</td>', 'I am so pleased to see some folks taking a chance in this challenge with some great artistic twists. Another - Freedom of Expression I love the black/white.I think without the title it''s kinda far out there. But I like it.', '2003-09-12 02:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(416455, 37448, 11034, '<td valign="top">Love is the only freedom. My fav shoot.</td>', 'Love is the only freedom. My fav shoot.', '2003-09-12 02:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(416460, 37325, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup of the three crayons. It really shows the waxyness of the crayons. The shadows and reflections really make them pop out. The white background really helps it pop out too. You can almost feel the texture of the fibers in the paper. Great shot.</td>', 'Nice closeup of the three crayons. It really shows the waxyness of the crayons. The shadows and reflections really make them pop out. The white background really helps it pop out too. You can almost feel the texture of the fibers in the paper. Great shot.', '2003-09-12 02:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(416462, 37325, 11034, '<td valign="top">France flag?</td>', 'France flag?', '2003-09-12 02:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(416463, 37380, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Love the vertical format Makes your eyes look from the bottom of the pole to the top of the flag. The soldier saluting the flag is a really nice touch.<br/> <br/>The desaturation job really makes the flay pop out. The color that the soldier still has in his camoflage is really nice. Great shot.</td>', 'Great composition. Love the vertical format Makes your eyes look from the bottom of the pole to the top of the flag. The soldier saluting the flag is a really nice touch. The desaturation job really makes the flay pop out. The color that the soldier still has in his camoflage is really nice. Great shot.', '2003-09-12 02:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(416468, 37448, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wow really beautiful lighting here. Gives the piece a very fantasy feeling. The interesting background with the darkness and the lighting really makes the wings and the heart pop out of the picture.<br/> <br/>Frame works great with this picture. Wonderful image.</td>', 'Wow really beautiful lighting here. Gives the piece a very fantasy feeling. The interesting background with the darkness and the lighting really makes the wings and the heart pop out of the picture. Frame works great with this picture. Wonderful image.', '2003-09-12 03:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(416470, 37400, 9285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Shot... I love this...  10<br/>:o)<br/>"Tears of a Nation" :o)</td>', 'Beautiful Shot... I love this...  10:o)"Tears of a Nation" :o)', '2003-09-12 03:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(416476, 37427, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the reflection.  it adds a lot to the picture, and gives it more interest other than looking at names only.  something for me that would make the picture even that much better would be to have the names a little straighter.  the angle the picture was taken gives them a weird tilted perspective toward the right.  however, overall its a very nice shot.</td>', 'i really like the reflection.  it adds a lot to the picture, and gives it more interest other than looking at names only.  something for me that would make the picture even that much better would be to have the names a little straighter.  the angle the picture was taken gives them a weird tilted perspective toward the right.  however, overall its a very nice shot.', '2003-09-12 03:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(416477, 37435, 259, '<td valign="top">thats a cool pin.</td>', 'thats a cool pin.', '2003-09-12 03:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(416478, 37448, 259, '<td valign="top">i am very impressed with the lighting. nice job.</td>', 'i am very impressed with the lighting. nice job.', '2003-09-12 03:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(416479, 37377, 259, '<td valign="top">the angle is great</td>', 'the angle is great', '2003-09-12 03:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(416483, 37456, 259, '<td valign="top">so freedom is just Matthew 4 and 5, or the whole Bible?  i''m just kidding with ya.</td>', 'so freedom is just Matthew 4 and 5, or the whole Bible?  i''m just kidding with ya.', '2003-09-12 03:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(416485, 37406, 259, '<td valign="top">the color in this shot is just amazing</td>', 'the color in this shot is just amazing', '2003-09-12 03:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(416486, 37399, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice color</td>', 'very nice color', '2003-09-12 03:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(416487, 37339, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture. Great lighting in the picture . It''s very vivid and clear. Love the lighting that you captured behind the door. Love the details of it and the reflection off the doorknob.<br/>The contrast of the piece gives it a very graphic look. Very nice.</td>', 'Very interesting picture. Great lighting in the picture . It''s very vivid and clear. Love the lighting that you captured behind the door. Love the details of it and the reflection off the doorknob.The contrast of the piece gives it a very graphic look. Very nice.', '2003-09-12 04:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(416488, 37459, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The light gives off a great illumination of the piece. A bit dark but your can still see the American flag on the Zippo. This would make a great card or postcard.</td>', 'Great composition. The light gives off a great illumination of the piece. A bit dark but your can still see the American flag on the Zippo. This would make a great card or postcard.', '2003-09-12 04:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(416490, 37340, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Great touch with the American flag pen. The pens'' placement give the piece more interest. It makes your eyes look from the blue down the shaft toward the red. Thus making you look at the candiates top to bottom.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Great touch with the American flag pen. The pens'' placement give the piece more interest. It makes your eyes look from the blue down the shaft toward the red. Thus making you look at the candiates top to bottom.', '2003-09-12 04:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(416492, 37458, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that you used for this shot. Gives the tower and the cross great interest against the background of the sky. I would like it more if the tower and cross had more contrast. That way it would really pop out of the picture.</td>', 'I like the angle that you used for this shot. Gives the tower and the cross great interest against the background of the sky. I would like it more if the tower and cross had more contrast. That way it would really pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-12 04:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(416501, 37443, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The flags'' color are very vivid. Good desaturation job. You were able to capture some really nice shadows in the type of the monument. Absolutely beautiful.<br/> <br/>The focus is great in this picture. From the shadows and reflections of the grass to the monument and to the background. Very nice.</td>', 'Great composition. The flags'' color are very vivid. Good desaturation job. You were able to capture some really nice shadows in the type of the monument. Absolutely beautiful. The focus is great in this picture. From the shadows and reflections of the grass to the monument and to the background. Very nice.', '2003-09-12 04:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(416505, 37350, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wish we could see more details of the seagulls. The composition is nice because of the flying one. It gives the shot something to focus on. Getting the ground on the shot gives it some colors. Since the water, sky, and seagulls are all the same colors.</td>', 'Wish we could see more details of the seagulls. The composition is nice because of the flying one. It gives the shot something to focus on. Getting the ground on the shot gives it some colors. Since the water, sky, and seagulls are all the same colors.', '2003-09-12 04:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
