(417525, 37344, 10768, '<td valign="top">Love the background on this photo.  It enhances the focal point without competing with it.  Very powerful display for this theme.  10</td>', 'Love the background on this photo.  It enhances the focal point without competing with it.  Very powerful display for this theme.  10', '2003-09-13 01:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(417530, 37424, 10768, '<td valign="top">What better freedom than quitting time?  Good use of the theme.  It''s funny how a simple keyboard in the background can immediately conjure up the image of the workplace.  Nice composition and the reversal makes the watch appear to glow drawing all of the attention to the time.  Well done.</td>', 'What better freedom than quitting time?  Good use of the theme.  It''s funny how a simple keyboard in the background can immediately conjure up the image of the workplace.  Nice composition and the reversal makes the watch appear to glow drawing all of the attention to the time.  Well done.', '2003-09-13 01:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(417535, 37435, 10768, '<td valign="top">Where did you find that button?  It''s perfect for this challenge.  Nice composition and clear sharp image.  Nice work.</td>', 'Where did you find that button?  It''s perfect for this challenge.  Nice composition and clear sharp image.  Nice work.', '2003-09-13 01:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(417564, 37384, 12155, '<td valign="top">Getting international ey?  Good composition, great theme with the handcuffs!</td>', 'Getting international ey?  Good composition, great theme with the handcuffs!', '2003-09-13 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(417780, 37443, 9906, '<td valign="top">The flag is a little too sharp and hurts my eyes.  There is no color in the grass though! Otherwise great composition!</td>', 'The flag is a little too sharp and hurts my eyes.  There is no color in the grass though! Otherwise great composition!', '2003-09-13 02:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(417783, 37454, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it....Where is the freedom that is fading???  What is the machinery that we are looking at???  This is a cool name, cool concept (fading away of our freedoms) but don''t see freedom here because the subject is an unknown variable...  If it was a typewriter or a gun or a bible (church, cross, insert religious symbol here) and all else was equal, 8 or more....this doesn''t get that though.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t get it....Where is the freedom that is fading???  What is the machinery that we are looking at???  This is a cool name, cool concept (fading away of our freedoms) but don''t see freedom here because the subject is an unknown variable...  If it was a typewriter or a gun or a bible (church, cross, insert religious symbol here) and all else was equal, 8 or more....this doesn''t get that though. Hope this helps.TC', '2003-09-13 03:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(417786, 37455, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m making an assumption here that because of the monuments subject that the monument is black.  Given this....I think that this woulda been more powerful left in color because hues and colors in the reflections would make it ''blacker''.  Focus is a little soft.   The title I think in this case detracts from the image.  The first thing I thougt while it was loading was ''duh'' because the title is right there in the image.  I don''t usualy detract for title but in this case if it was title"____________________ memorial" I woulda had more feeling for it...<br/> <br/>Hope it helps....<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m making an assumption here that because of the monuments subject that the monument is black.  Given this....I think that this woulda been more powerful left in color because hues and colors in the reflections would make it ''blacker''.  Focus is a little soft.   The title I think in this case detracts from the image.  The first thing I thougt while it was loading was ''duh'' because the title is right there in the image.  I don''t usualy detract for title but in this case if it was title"____________________ memorial" I woulda had more feeling for it... Hope it helps....TC', '2003-09-13 03:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(417809, 37352, 7151, '<td valign="top">A thoughtful contrast of a hopeful title with a grim reality.  Though someone should figure out a better representation for blood and share it with everyone - the tomato sauce sort of gives a sort of mock quality to an otherwise serious message.  Framing and composition are good, though lighting and focus are a bit off.  The grainyness works OK though with the subject matter.</td>', 'A thoughtful contrast of a hopeful title with a grim reality.  Though someone should figure out a better representation for blood and share it with everyone - the tomato sauce sort of gives a sort of mock quality to an otherwise serious message.  Framing and composition are good, though lighting and focus are a bit off.  The grainyness works OK though with the subject matter.', '2003-09-13 05:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(417825, 37358, 5783, '<td valign="top">BRILLIANT a flag that "REALLY" stands for freedom ...nice...10</td>', 'BRILLIANT a flag that "REALLY" stands for freedom ...nice...10', '2003-09-13 07:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(417827, 37372, 5783, '<td valign="top">Lots of these flags... but does it really stand for freedom???? nice photo though</td>', 'Lots of these flags... but does it really stand for freedom???? nice photo though', '2003-09-13 07:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(417832, 37451, 11738, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the lighting on this photo.  The shadow on the base underneath the metal sign is distracting.  Something was partially blocking your light source (headlights?).</td>', 'I enjoy the lighting on this photo.  The shadow on the base underneath the metal sign is distracting.  Something was partially blocking your light source (headlights?).', '2003-09-13 08:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(417834, 37405, 11738, '<td valign="top">I LOVE old books.  What an heirloom!  I do find  the folds in the black material distrcating since it''s hard to make them out.  This might have a case for a lighter coloured material for this shot.</td>', 'I LOVE old books.  What an heirloom!  I do find  the folds in the black material distrcating since it''s hard to make them out.  This might have a case for a lighter coloured material for this shot.', '2003-09-13 08:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(417835, 37458, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice concpet but I find this photo a tad too dark.  Too bad weather was not more on your side with a clear sky (uplifting) or a dark menacing sky (forboding)</td>', 'Nice concpet but I find this photo a tad too dark.  Too bad weather was not more on your side with a clear sky (uplifting) or a dark menacing sky (forboding)', '2003-09-13 08:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(417838, 37374, 11738, '<td valign="top">Won''t get far with an almost empty fuel tank!  LOL!  I like the angle and the clean focus</td>', 'Won''t get far with an almost empty fuel tank!  LOL!  I like the angle and the clean focus', '2003-09-13 08:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(417866, 37374, 2000, '<td valign="top">Neat effect, although I''m unsure of your intention here.</td>', 'Neat effect, although I''m unsure of your intention here.', '2003-09-13 10:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(417867, 37352, 2000, '<td valign="top">I think I understand your purpose.  Colors a bit odd, but not bad.</td>', 'I think I understand your purpose.  Colors a bit odd, but not bad.', '2003-09-13 10:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(417868, 37451, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good concept, pretty well executed.  I like the use of negative space here to enhance the drama of the stone.</td>', 'Good concept, pretty well executed.  I like the use of negative space here to enhance the drama of the stone.', '2003-09-13 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(417869, 37342, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the concept... a direct representation of a quote from the constitution.  But nothing in the photograph is level (true horizontal/vertical) and it looks crooked.  I think the best correction for this would have been to straighten the US flag - I think it''s off by &lt;5 degrees, but the way the eye views the photo, something has to be straight in it.</td>', 'I like the concept... a direct representation of a quote from the constitution.  But nothing in the photograph is level (true horizontal/vertical) and it looks crooked.  I think the best correction for this would have been to straighten the US flag - I think it''s off by <5 degrees, but the way the eye views the photo, something has to be straight in it.', '2003-09-13 10:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(417871, 37348, 2000, '<td valign="top">These appear to be candles, but it''s really unclear as to what''s burning.</td>', 'These appear to be candles, but it''s really unclear as to what''s burning.', '2003-09-13 10:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(417872, 37325, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and concept here.  Also, the thought that with these three colors, anything can be be created, including the flags of several countries... a good concept of freedom. Depth of field was some thing you used here, but I don''t know that it adds anything to the party (blurred bottom of crayons). 8</td>', 'I like the perspective and concept here.  Also, the thought that with these three colors, anything can be be created, including the flags of several countries... a good concept of freedom. Depth of field was some thing you used here, but I don''t know that it adds anything to the party (blurred bottom of crayons). 8', '2003-09-13 10:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(417873, 37406, 2000, '<td valign="top">Did you go back inside afterwards to let them know the US flag is ripped?  Good concept.</td>', 'Did you go back inside afterwards to let them know the US flag is ripped?  Good concept.', '2003-09-13 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(417874, 37378, 2000, '<td valign="top">another use of negative space, although without the title, I''d never have any idea what you shooting for,</td>', 'another use of negative space, although without the title, I''d never have any idea what you shooting for,', '2003-09-13 10:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(417875, 37399, 2000, '<td valign="top">The only criticism is to take the exposure down a 1/2 step if you could do that with your camera.  Otherwise, this is a photo that stands on its own as an example of a very well-known concept.</td>', 'The only criticism is to take the exposure down a 1/2 step if you could do that with your camera.  Otherwise, this is a photo that stands on its own as an example of a very well-known concept.', '2003-09-13 10:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(417876, 37458, 2000, '<td valign="top">A rotation adjustment of roughly 1 degree to the right would make the side of the steeple straight... and that''s the only complaint I have.  The sky works well as negative space here, empacizing the church and therefore your idea.  Too bad the weather wasn''t nicer, since the overall photo is a bit dark, but works ok for this.</td>', 'A rotation adjustment of roughly 1 degree to the right would make the side of the steeple straight... and that''s the only complaint I have.  The sky works well as negative space here, empacizing the church and therefore your idea.  Too bad the weather wasn''t nicer, since the overall photo is a bit dark, but works ok for this.', '2003-09-13 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(417877, 37401, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, funny title.  I hope you stated what these tanks are in your comments about the pic.</td>', 'Cool pic, funny title.  I hope you stated what these tanks are in your comments about the pic.', '2003-09-13 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(417878, 37397, 2000, '<td valign="top">This photo has no stabilizatoin point... a motion shot needs to have a solid/immobile foundation in order to not make the viewer dizzy.</td>', 'This photo has no stabilizatoin point... a motion shot needs to have a solid/immobile foundation in order to not make the viewer dizzy.', '2003-09-13 10:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(417879, 37440, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very good concept, and well executed too.</td>', 'Very good concept, and well executed too.', '2003-09-13 10:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(417880, 37332, 2000, '<td valign="top">I think I see where you''re going, but it took me a while to see what you were showing me.</td>', 'I think I see where you''re going, but it took me a while to see what you were showing me.', '2003-09-13 10:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(417881, 37344, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of depth of field.</td>', 'Very nice use of depth of field.', '2003-09-13 10:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(417882, 37402, 2000, '<td valign="top">Something in this photograph needs to be levelized (made horizontal/vertical)... it feels tilted.</td>', 'Something in this photograph needs to be levelized (made horizontal/vertical)... it feels tilted.', '2003-09-13 10:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(417883, 37441, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cool reflection idea.</td>', 'Cool reflection idea.', '2003-09-13 10:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(417885, 37384, 2000, '<td valign="top">Creative concept for a country''s independance day... and this associated freedoms that stem from it.  I have to ask, since I don''t know that I''ve seen this flag before - is the eagle eating a snake?</td>', 'Creative concept for a country''s independance day... and this associated freedoms that stem from it.  I have to ask, since I don''t know that I''ve seen this flag before - is the eagle eating a snake?', '2003-09-13 10:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(417887, 37410, 2000, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is a bit tight - unless you were going for having only the keys in foxus, this is blurrier than expected.</td>', 'Depth of field is a bit tight - unless you were going for having only the keys in foxus, this is blurrier than expected.', '2003-09-13 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(417888, 37432, 2000, '<td valign="top">funny pic.</td>', 'funny pic.', '2003-09-13 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(417891, 37396, 2000, '<td valign="top">Obviously an impossible ballot, but I like the concept.  Color choices are on purpose, I imagine.</td>', 'Obviously an impossible ballot, but I like the concept.  Color choices are on purpose, I imagine.', '2003-09-13 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(417904, 37402, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good one with strong diagonal, as well as strong emotive quality.</td>', 'Good one with strong diagonal, as well as strong emotive quality.', '2003-09-13 11:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(417905, 37444, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection.  Cool pic though.</td>', 'I don''t get the connection.  Cool pic though.', '2003-09-13 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(417907, 37427, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good with the  reflection too.</td>', 'Nice!  Good with the  reflection too.', '2003-09-13 12:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(417910, 37384, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice conceptual shot with symbolic elements.  Good colour.  A wee bit more contrast would perk it up.  Still well executed. :-)</td>', 'Nice conceptual shot with symbolic elements.  Good colour.  A wee bit more contrast would perk it up.  Still well executed. :-)', '2003-09-13 12:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(417912, 37400, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but without the title, it doesn''t speak freedom.  Nice angles here.</td>', 'Interesting, but without the title, it doesn''t speak freedom.  Nice angles here.', '2003-09-13 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(417914, 37450, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good!  It''s true, that there are endless possibilities.</td>', 'Very good!  It''s true, that there are endless possibilities.', '2003-09-13 12:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(417915, 37378, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  It''s a stretch to meet the challenge though.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  It''s a stretch to meet the challenge though.', '2003-09-13 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(417917, 37443, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  Crisp focus, and good concept, well executed.</td>', 'Beautifully done!  Crisp focus, and good concept, well executed.', '2003-09-13 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(417923, 37352, 1280, '<td valign="top">But there is no way around it.  Except perhaps spiritual freedom, but the more I consider it, even spiritual freedom costs.  <br/>Good concept picture, emotive, well planned and well executed...no pun intended.<br/>I like the diagonal composition, the warm colouring.  <br/>there will prolly be folks who will say the blood looks fake...ignore them...lol.  I once submitted one that I got that comment.  It wasn''t the greatest pic, for various reasons, but the fake blood comment...duh....I wasn''t gonna use REAL blood.  <br/>Good job here!!! Best of luck!</td>', 'But there is no way around it.  Except perhaps spiritual freedom, but the more I consider it, even spiritual freedom costs.  Good concept picture, emotive, well planned and well executed...no pun intended.I like the diagonal composition, the warm colouring.  there will prolly be folks who will say the blood looks fake...ignore them...lol.  I once submitted one that I got that comment.  It wasn''t the greatest pic, for various reasons, but the fake blood comment...duh....I wasn''t gonna use REAL blood.  Good job here!!! Best of luck!', '2003-09-13 12:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(417925, 37422, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and I appreciate the concept...I thank God for freedom of religion.  Technically the hands are blurred, and the pic is a bit dark on my monitor, with some distracting highlights on the left of the cross, and on the bottom, left of the hands.  There isn''t enough detail to tell what it is though.</td>', 'I like the idea, and I appreciate the concept...I thank God for freedom of religion.  Technically the hands are blurred, and the pic is a bit dark on my monitor, with some distracting highlights on the left of the cross, and on the bottom, left of the hands.  There isn''t enough detail to tell what it is though.', '2003-09-13 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(417930, 37435, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good example, since not everyone is free to read what they want.  Including religious books like the Bible!</td>', 'Good example, since not everyone is free to read what they want.  Including religious books like the Bible!', '2003-09-13 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(417932, 37377, 1280, '<td valign="top">Yes!!!  Very good!</td>', 'Yes!!!  Very good!', '2003-09-13 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(417934, 37358, 1280, '<td valign="top">Yes indeed!  We are fortunate to live in countries that allow that.  Nice lines here too...angles, texture, colour.  Good job!   :-)</td>', 'Yes indeed!  We are fortunate to live in countries that allow that.  Nice lines here too...angles, texture, colour.  Good job!   :-)', '2003-09-13 13:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(417955, 37397, 1280, '<td valign="top">Compelling image, but not sure I see the connection.  Are they praising God?  Please let me know.</td>', 'Compelling image, but not sure I see the connection.  Are they praising God?  Please let me know.', '2003-09-13 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(417963, 37423, 12169, '<td valign="top">Great colours!!!! One of the most vibrant photos that I have seen in a long time. Really like it.</td>', 'Great colours!!!! One of the most vibrant photos that I have seen in a long time. Really like it.', '2003-09-13 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(417971, 37352, 3459, '<td valign="top">Freedom as everything else costs, the question is what''s the cost?  Great image though, and 8!</td>', 'Freedom as everything else costs, the question is what''s the cost?  Great image though, and 8!', '2003-09-13 14:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(417972, 37454, 3459, '<td valign="top">What great message! A 10!</td>', 'What great message! A 10!', '2003-09-13 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(417973, 37339, 3459, '<td valign="top">One of the best in this challenge! A 10!</td>', 'One of the best in this challenge! A 10!', '2003-09-13 14:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(417977, 37332, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great message!</td>', 'Great message!', '2003-09-13 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(418004, 37399, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite shot in the challenge, wonderful!</td>', 'This is my favourite shot in the challenge, wonderful!', '2003-09-13 15:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(418033, 37358, 280, '<td valign="top">Well it makes a camge from an Ameriacan flag,  just a little too much wall would have liked to have seen a little more of the background.</td>', 'Well it makes a camge from an Ameriacan flag,  just a little too much wall would have liked to have seen a little more of the background.', '2003-09-13 18:21:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(418034, 37339, 3087, '<td valign="top">With no disrespect intended whatsoever to all the patriotic 9/11 inspired entries which give thought to that tragedy, I am pleased to see this alternative interpretation of the challenge theme. I love the simplicity of the shot and the choice of such dark shadows, whilst initially something I wasn''t sure about, has grown on me - this makes me think of childhood nights... wide awake when I should have been asleep and longing for the freedom to join the lively adult conversation downstairs.</td>', 'With no disrespect intended whatsoever to all the patriotic 9/11 inspired entries which give thought to that tragedy, I am pleased to see this alternative interpretation of the challenge theme. I love the simplicity of the shot and the choice of such dark shadows, whilst initially something I wasn''t sure about, has grown on me - this makes me think of childhood nights... wide awake when I should have been asleep and longing for the freedom to join the lively adult conversation downstairs.', '2003-09-13 18:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(418035, 37347, 3087, '<td valign="top">Another evocative alternative to the patriotic and heartfelt 911-related images. This reminds me very much of Jonathan Livingstone Seagull by Richard Bach.</td>', 'Another evocative alternative to the patriotic and heartfelt 911-related images. This reminds me very much of Jonathan Livingstone Seagull by Richard Bach.', '2003-09-13 18:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(418036, 37441, 280, '<td valign="top">Well captured within the DPC rules, skin looks ever so slightly pale tho.</td>', 'Well captured within the DPC rules, skin looks ever so slightly pale tho.', '2003-09-13 18:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(418037, 37397, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a creative and unusual image! I really like the ghostly aspect of the arms and faces and the colour tones too. I love the darkness in most of the image and find the white area below off putting. Nevertheless I like the idea and much of the execution of this very much.</td>', 'What a creative and unusual image! I really like the ghostly aspect of the arms and faces and the colour tones too. I love the darkness in most of the image and find the white area below off putting. Nevertheless I like the idea and much of the execution of this very much.', '2003-09-13 18:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(418038, 37435, 3087, '<td valign="top">The message here is more powerful (for me) than the image itself. Well said though!</td>', 'The message here is more powerful (for me) than the image itself. Well said though!', '2003-09-13 18:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(418040, 37378, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the message but I like the image much more than I expected to from the thumbnail. Such a beautiful elipse... strangely mesmerising.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the message but I like the image much more than I expected to from the thumbnail. Such a beautiful elipse... strangely mesmerising.', '2003-09-13 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(418045, 37456, 280, '<td valign="top">You can see white at the edge of this image where you have rotated it, I think you should have cropped to remove this.</td>', 'You can see white at the edge of this image where you have rotated it, I think you should have cropped to remove this.', '2003-09-13 18:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(418080, 37411, 6667, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea. It appears the focus was beyond the cake and book (at least on my computer).  Greater depth of field would have been right on.</td>', 'This is a neat idea. It appears the focus was beyond the cake and book (at least on my computer).  Greater depth of field would have been right on.', '2003-09-13 20:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418090, 37446, 6667, '<td valign="top">Subtle and to the point.  After the initial response that this meets the challenge  to a tee. . .the next thing my eye was drawn to was the carpet of green clover. . . and not a four leaf one in the bunch!  Somehow this even added to the headline.  Then, the  more I looked the more it said!  Curious as to the sisters grave.  What''s the story there?   Best of luck.</td>', 'Subtle and to the point.  After the initial response that this meets the challenge  to a tee. . .the next thing my eye was drawn to was the carpet of green clover. . . and not a four leaf one in the bunch!  Somehow this even added to the headline.  Then, the  more I looked the more it said!  Curious as to the sisters grave.  What''s the story there?   Best of luck.', '2003-09-13 21:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(418104, 37323, 6667, '<td valign="top">Says a lot.  First thought:  Priceless!  I bet they would like a print.  Did they get one?  Best of luck</td>', 'Says a lot.  First thought:  Priceless!  I bet they would like a print.  Did they get one?  Best of luck', '2003-09-13 21:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(418399, 37411, 6504, '<td valign="top">A little dob of ice cream would be nice too.   I think this is the most creative of all the submissions.   Nicely photographed</td>', 'A little dob of ice cream would be nice too.   I think this is the most creative of all the submissions.   Nicely photographed', '2003-09-13 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(418400, 37340, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!   I think this will be in the top three for sure!  Excellent lighting, compostion and clarity.   Perfect in every way.</td>', 'Beautifully done!   I think this will be in the top three for sure!  Excellent lighting, compostion and clarity.   Perfect in every way.', '2003-09-13 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418404, 37396, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is a good one for sure.   It''s a little eerie, though.  Did you mean for the hand to look like a dead person''s?</td>', 'This is a good one for sure.   It''s a little eerie, though.  Did you mean for the hand to look like a dead person''s?', '2003-09-13 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(418405, 37344, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  The muted background of the flag and the sharpness of the tags is perfect.    Nice title on top of it.</td>', 'Beautiful!  The muted background of the flag and the sharpness of the tags is perfect.    Nice title on top of it.', '2003-09-13 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(418406, 37323, 6504, '<td valign="top">They are just babies.   What a wonderful capture.  His dirty hands really make it look like he just came back from battle.    Excellent in every way.  The expressions on their faces is priceless.</td>', 'They are just babies.   What a wonderful capture.  His dirty hands really make it look like he just came back from battle.    Excellent in every way.  The expressions on their faces is priceless.', '2003-09-13 23:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(418421, 37432, 9810, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, If I could vote on it I would give it a 10!</td>', 'Cute picture, If I could vote on it I would give it a 10!', '2003-09-14 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(418422, 37440, 9810, '<td valign="top">Hehe I get my permit in 9 days, you got me in perticular in a nutshell, nice picture, nice subject!</td>', 'Hehe I get my permit in 9 days, you got me in perticular in a nutshell, nice picture, nice subject!', '2003-09-14 00:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(418441, 37323, 9441, '<td valign="top">Great photo, brings home the reality of those who are fighting to bring us freedom and what their loved ones must go through in parting with them in order to bring us this freedom.</td>', 'Great photo, brings home the reality of those who are fighting to bring us freedom and what their loved ones must go through in parting with them in order to bring us this freedom.', '2003-09-14 00:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
