(418682, 37444, 9504, '<td valign="top">Very awesome photo!  Great title too...  I hope you are a fore-runner in this challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very awesome photo!  Great title too...  I hope you are a fore-runner in this challenge. ', '2003-09-14 13:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(418699, 37435, 8081, '<td valign="top">Even though I''m not a member and can''t vote on the challenge, I love this photo...especially since I have read every book in the pile that I could read the title on.  Great look at freedom, IMO.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Even though I''m not a member and can''t vote on the challenge, I love this photo...especially since I have read every book in the pile that I could read the title on.  Great look at freedom, IMO.  Very nicely done!', '2003-09-14 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(418700, 37440, 8081, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  What caught my eye was definitely the driver''s license...probably because I waited so long and was so proud when I got mine...it really was a true moment of freedom for me.  The funny thing is mine is from the state of NC, too!</td>', 'Neat shot!  What caught my eye was definitely the driver''s license...probably because I waited so long and was so proud when I got mine...it really was a true moment of freedom for me.  The funny thing is mine is from the state of NC, too!', '2003-09-14 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(418701, 37403, 8081, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...if I could vote I would give it a 10.  Nice composition, great DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful shot...if I could vote I would give it a 10.  Nice composition, great DOF.', '2003-09-14 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(418724, 37435, 11457, '<td valign="top">Clever, original idea (good selection of books!). I would have liked a better lighting, to get rid of those strong reflections on the plastic covers. If possible, I would have taken away the plastic covers altogether, to make the book titles more prominent.</td>', 'Clever, original idea (good selection of books!). I would have liked a better lighting, to get rid of those strong reflections on the plastic covers. If possible, I would have taken away the plastic covers altogether, to make the book titles more prominent.', '2003-09-14 15:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(418725, 37332, 11457, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! I think that leaving only the TC/receiver set in the trash can would have made the message more effective.</td>', 'Nice idea! I think that leaving only the TC/receiver set in the trash can would have made the message more effective.', '2003-09-14 15:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(418783, 37332, 7151, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The photos a bit so-so though.  I think it''s mainly in the composition - it''s a little too centered.  Maybe tighter on the TV and satelite dish, with just enough of the garbage can to recognize what it is, would have been a little more interesting, visually.</td>', 'Great idea.  The photos a bit so-so though.  I think it''s mainly in the composition - it''s a little too centered.  Maybe tighter on the TV and satelite dish, with just enough of the garbage can to recognize what it is, would have been a little more interesting, visually.', '2003-09-14 18:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(418785, 37350, 7151, '<td valign="top">I almost did this too!  But I couldn''t get any good shots.</td>', 'I almost did this too!  But I couldn''t get any good shots.', '2003-09-14 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
