(418959, 37443, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great use of color. Look forward to hearing how you did it.</td>', 'Great use of color. Look forward to hearing how you did it.', '2003-09-14 23:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(418963, 37424, 3554, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I like it as a negative, adds interest to what would have been a dull shot.</td>', 'Good concept. I like it as a negative, adds interest to what would have been a dull shot.', '2003-09-14 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(418968, 37432, 3554, '<td valign="top">Personally I find this picture uninteresting. The idea isn\''t bad but I don\''t get a sense of excitement about the dog getting his freedom. Being stationary he apperas more reluctant than anything. Perhaps if you\''d shot it from the other direction (facing  the dog attempting to escape) and a little lower it would have turned out better.</td>', 'Personally I find this picture uninteresting. The idea isn\''t bad but I don\''t get a sense of excitement about the dog getting his freedom. Being stationary he apperas more reluctant than anything. Perhaps if you\''d shot it from the other direction (facing  the dog attempting to escape) and a little lower it would have turned out better.', '2003-09-15 00:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(418973, 37352, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don\''t particularly care for the orange hue and the red liquid doesn\''t at all look like blood (if that''s what it\''s supposed to be)  I\''m not sure the open lock really works either. It seems like a stretch for what you are trying to do.</td>', 'I don\''t particularly care for the orange hue and the red liquid doesn\''t at all look like blood (if that''s what it\''s supposed to be)  I\''m not sure the open lock really works either. It seems like a stretch for what you are trying to do.', '2003-09-15 00:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(418980, 37323, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, something about it keeps drawing me back.  The young soldier returning to that which he fights to protect. Very nice depection of freedom. I find the uniform and civillian clothes to make a nice contrast as well.</td>', 'I really like this shot, something about it keeps drawing me back.  The young soldier returning to that which he fights to protect. Very nice depection of freedom. I find the uniform and civillian clothes to make a nice contrast as well.', '2003-09-15 00:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(418983, 37340, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for the challenge. Seems like the focus could have been a little sharper on the pen.</td>', 'Nice concept for the challenge. Seems like the focus could have been a little sharper on the pen.', '2003-09-15 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(419112, 37397, 2284, '<td valign="top">Nice - Fantastic</td>', 'Nice - Fantastic', '2003-09-15 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(419355, 37441, 3084, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  9 Morgan</td>', 'Nice image.  9 Morgan', '2003-09-15 10:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(419356, 37323, 3084, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  9 Morgan</td>', 'Nice image.  9 Morgan', '2003-09-15 10:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(419357, 37372, 3084, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  8 Morgan</td>', 'Nice image.  8 Morgan', '2003-09-15 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(419359, 37432, 3084, '<td valign="top">Thank you for offering a different interpretation of the challenge.  Many confused this challenge with one about flags, or used it as an opportunity to be excessively patriotic.  So, I appreciated your submission even more because it did not pursue these themes.  <br/> <br/>By the way, my dogs would have been long gone, so I could have never taken this image  myself.  10  Morgan</td>', 'Thank you for offering a different interpretation of the challenge.  Many confused this challenge with one about flags, or used it as an opportunity to be excessively patriotic.  So, I appreciated your submission even more because it did not pursue these themes.   By the way, my dogs would have been long gone, so I could have never taken this image  myself.  10  Morgan', '2003-09-15 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(419440, 37377, 8816, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, great exposure, and nice job desaturating as to bring out the flag.   The only problem I see is that many members of your audience will not view the American flag or the ten commandments as symbols of freedom, I''m not saying that they don''t represent freedom for you personally, but audience is always something you must look at.</td>', 'An interesting idea, great exposure, and nice job desaturating as to bring out the flag.   The only problem I see is that many members of your audience will not view the American flag or the ten commandments as symbols of freedom, I''m not saying that they don''t represent freedom for you personally, but audience is always something you must look at.', '2003-09-15 11:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(419442, 37401, 8816, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a bit blurry at the top, but well I think I''m just being picky.  I think this picture is missing that wow factor, possibly in post-processing you could have done something to give the photo a slight kick.  Wondering if the idea of the american flag as a symbol of freedom will narrow your prospective audience range though, as many people do not see the american flag as a symbol for freedom, even if you do.  Just something to think about!</td>', 'Nice shot, a bit blurry at the top, but well I think I''m just being picky.  I think this picture is missing that wow factor, possibly in post-processing you could have done something to give the photo a slight kick.  Wondering if the idea of the american flag as a symbol of freedom will narrow your prospective audience range though, as many people do not see the american flag as a symbol for freedom, even if you do.  Just something to think about!', '2003-09-15 11:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(419445, 37443, 8816, '<td valign="top">Nice simple photo, with a clear message.  That message may be lost to more then half of your audience though, as the american flag does not mean freedom to a lot of people.  Even if it does so for you, you always have to consider who your audience is.</td>', 'Nice simple photo, with a clear message.  That message may be lost to more then half of your audience though, as the american flag does not mean freedom to a lot of people.  Even if it does so for you, you always have to consider who your audience is.', '2003-09-15 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(419450, 37424, 8816, '<td valign="top">Is this done with infrared?  It''s a crazy effect, and used interestingly here.  I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop i think, therefore putting more emphasize on the watch, but otherwise a good shot, very techniquealy (spelling oops) well done!</td>', 'Is this done with infrared?  It''s a crazy effect, and used interestingly here.  I would have liked to have seen a tighter crop i think, therefore putting more emphasize on the watch, but otherwise a good shot, very techniquealy (spelling oops) well done!', '2003-09-15 11:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(419453, 37435, 8816, '<td valign="top">The photo is made by the button!  Your meaning is clear and precise, and you achieved it so simply, without any special effects (so to speak).  Love the tight crop, a border may have helped though.  This is one of my favourites so far!</td>', 'The photo is made by the button!  Your meaning is clear and precise, and you achieved it so simply, without any special effects (so to speak).  Love the tight crop, a border may have helped though.  This is one of my favourites so far!', '2003-09-15 11:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(419582, 37323, 2764, '<td valign="top">I wish my son could come home from Afghanistan - he''s only 19.</td>', 'I wish my son could come home from Afghanistan - he''s only 19.', '2003-09-15 12:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
