(419600, 37342, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooohhh finally an nice photo to go with all the nice sentiments in this challenge - my favorite so far!</td>', 'ooohhh finally an nice photo to go with all the nice sentiments in this challenge - my favorite so far!', '2003-09-15 12:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(419914, 37397, 2883, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt at the effect. Unfortunately, the ghost images blend in with each other too much, causing the photo to lose its meaning.</td>', 'I like the attempt at the effect. Unfortunately, the ghost images blend in with each other too much, causing the photo to lose its meaning.', '2003-09-15 17:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(419995, 37441, 12100, '<td valign="top">this is pretty damn cool</td>', 'this is pretty damn cool', '2003-09-15 18:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(419997, 37323, 12100, '<td valign="top">This really shows a lot of emotion, good way to capture the moment.</td>', 'This really shows a lot of emotion, good way to capture the moment.', '2003-09-15 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(420000, 37405, 12131, '<td valign="top">And you wonder why they think it is an old time faith.  Antique books rock.  Nice presentation.</td>', 'And you wonder why they think it is an old time faith.  Antique books rock.  Nice presentation.', '2003-09-15 18:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(420002, 37400, 12131, '<td valign="top">Had trouble figuring this one out at first but after I got it, I like it.  Very good imagery.</td>', 'Had trouble figuring this one out at first but after I got it, I like it.  Very good imagery.', '2003-09-15 18:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(420004, 37358, 12131, '<td valign="top">Booo.....no just kidding, I''m not vindictive and I do think that this one is very clearly saying that every one has a voice, no matter how unpopular or vice versa.  it''s a good message in this contest, though I find it difficult to except in this case.  Still nice colors and setting.   Very important message.</td>', 'Booo.....no just kidding, I''m not vindictive and I do think that this one is very clearly saying that every one has a voice, no matter how unpopular or vice versa.  it''s a good message in this contest, though I find it difficult to except in this case.  Still nice colors and setting.   Very important message.', '2003-09-15 19:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(420011, 37397, 12131, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Cool shot.  I like this one because it presents the idea of free movement, and passion and emotion.  It''s expressionistic, if that is even a word.  Love it.</td>', 'Wow!  Cool shot.  I like this one because it presents the idea of free movement, and passion and emotion.  It''s expressionistic, if that is even a word.  Love it.', '2003-09-15 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(420013, 37352, 12131, '<td valign="top">Sad image but your right, it shouldn''t have to come at a price.  Man, this makes me really upset.  Good job.</td>', 'Sad image but your right, it shouldn''t have to come at a price.  Man, this makes me really upset.  Good job.', '2003-09-15 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(420017, 37347, 12131, '<td valign="top">Clean, beautiful colors, fits the challenge nicely in that it promotes the best freedom of all, flying.  I only wish humans were free to do that.  Oh, well, I''ll work with what I have.</td>', 'Clean, beautiful colors, fits the challenge nicely in that it promotes the best freedom of all, flying.  I only wish humans were free to do that.  Oh, well, I''ll work with what I have.', '2003-09-15 19:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(420020, 37445, 12131, '<td valign="top">Okay, um, interesting image.  A little militaristic.  I hate to think that the voice of freedom is "move aside or I''ll kill you" or "don''t even attempt to bring your problems to my shore".  Still it''s creative.</td>', 'Okay, um, interesting image.  A little militaristic.  I hate to think that the voice of freedom is "move aside or I''ll kill you" or "don''t even attempt to bring your problems to my shore".  Still it''s creative.', '2003-09-15 19:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(420022, 37402, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shadows in the type of the "Freedom Memorial Park" really makes it pop out of the picture. I wished that more of the memorial was in the picture. A wider shot would have given the piece a more dramatic feeling.<br/>More depth of field would separate the eagle from the background trees would also make the eagle stand out. The colors are very similar, except the head of the eagle.</td>', 'Beautiful shadows in the type of the "Freedom Memorial Park" really makes it pop out of the picture. I wished that more of the memorial was in the picture. A wider shot would have given the piece a more dramatic feeling.More depth of field would separate the eagle from the background trees would also make the eagle stand out. The colors are very similar, except the head of the eagle.', '2003-09-15 19:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(420025, 37347, 10084, '<td valign="top">The different shades of the clouds make them look fluffier. With the silhouette of the land given such a dark color your eyes first focus on it. Then the clouds with its beautiful color pushes the land out. The bird is a bit small to really notice at first.<br/> <br/>A closer cropping of the bird , the land and the clouds would''ve given the picture a nicer composition.</td>', 'The different shades of the clouds make them look fluffier. With the silhouette of the land given such a dark color your eyes first focus on it. Then the clouds with its beautiful color pushes the land out. The bird is a bit small to really notice at first. A closer cropping of the bird , the land and the clouds would''ve given the picture a nicer composition.', '2003-09-15 19:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(420027, 37451, 10084, '<td valign="top">The lighting of the monument is really spooky. It make the piece very dramatic and moody. It really gives you a sense of the texture (what its made out of)of monument itself. Feels really smooth.<br/>The darkened background really helps to push the monument forward and pop out of the picture.</td>', 'The lighting of the monument is really spooky. It make the piece very dramatic and moody. It really gives you a sense of the texture (what its made out of)of monument itself. Feels really smooth.The darkened background really helps to push the monument forward and pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-15 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(420034, 37344, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of the dogtags. They really pop out of the picture because of the great depth of field. The background with the flag colors really bring out a feeling of freedom. <br/>You eyes are lead from the top down because of the reflections of the tag and you continue looking down and read the motto. Great shot.<br/></td>', 'Very nice shot of the dogtags. They really pop out of the picture because of the great depth of field. The background with the flag colors really bring out a feeling of freedom. You eyes are lead from the top down because of the reflections of the tag and you continue looking down and read the motto. Great shot.', '2003-09-15 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(420138, 37411, 10084, '<td valign="top">The background with the clouds really brings the cake, slippers and book alive. The little colors bring out the contrast of the darker items and pops them out of the shot. I feel that the worn out book cover distracts a bit. Everything else on display looks orderly and the book is really emphasized.</td>', 'The background with the clouds really brings the cake, slippers and book alive. The little colors bring out the contrast of the darker items and pops them out of the shot. I feel that the worn out book cover distracts a bit. Everything else on display looks orderly and the book is really emphasized.', '2003-09-15 22:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(420152, 37323, 10084, '<td valign="top">The muted colors give this touching scene an add impact. The focusing give a great depth of field. The couple really pop out of the picture.</td>', 'The muted colors give this touching scene an add impact. The focusing give a great depth of field. The couple really pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-15 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(420153, 37377, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I wish that you were able to include the whole flag. The picture says freedom to me. Both the religion and the flag help with this. It also is nice to include youth.<br/>The beautiful shadows that you capture makes it very bold. The desaturation adds a great detail to the shot. Excellent picture.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I wish that you were able to include the whole flag. The picture says freedom to me. Both the religion and the flag help with this. It also is nice to include youth.The beautiful shadows that you capture makes it very bold. The desaturation adds a great detail to the shot. Excellent picture.', '2003-09-15 23:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(420155, 37410, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like that you tried a different take then everybody else. Composition is very nice. The reflections, light, and shadows gives this handcuffs a lot of emphasize and bring it out of the background.<br/>The focusing on the keys and blurring of the handcuffs looks really good and gives it an appealing depth of field.</td>', 'I like that you tried a different take then everybody else. Composition is very nice. The reflections, light, and shadows gives this handcuffs a lot of emphasize and bring it out of the background.The focusing on the keys and blurring of the handcuffs looks really good and gives it an appealing depth of field.', '2003-09-15 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(420238, 37445, 8816, '<td valign="top">I find it sad that a gun is your voice of freedom, no offence, but are you by chance american?  A nice picture nonetheless.</td>', 'I find it sad that a gun is your voice of freedom, no offence, but are you by chance american?  A nice picture nonetheless.', '2003-09-16 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(420240, 37410, 8816, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like how you''ve focused this picture.  I think perhaps a black background may have been more effective as well, to bring out contrast.  A nice composition otherwise though.</td>', 'Not sure I like how you''ve focused this picture.  I think perhaps a black background may have been more effective as well, to bring out contrast.  A nice composition otherwise though.', '2003-09-16 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(420241, 37402, 8816, '<td valign="top">A simple message, and well done.  The picture is clear, except for a small amount of noise which is noticeable in the blue sky, perhaps achieved from to much sharpening.  Otherwise a nice shot!</td>', 'A simple message, and well done.  The picture is clear, except for a small amount of noise which is noticeable in the blue sky, perhaps achieved from to much sharpening.  Otherwise a nice shot!', '2003-09-16 00:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(420242, 37451, 8816, '<td valign="top">A nice shot.  A border may have increased the drama of this photo though.  I like the way shadows and darkness were used in the photo.  Overall one of the best of this photo done!</td>', 'A nice shot.  A border may have increased the drama of this photo though.  I like the way shadows and darkness were used in the photo.  Overall one of the best of this photo done!', '2003-09-16 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(420244, 37411, 8816, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I understand the topic of this.  Perhaps it is just a difference of opinions or interpretations of the challenge.  I like the composition of the photo though, the clouds are nicely achieved.  I would have liked to see a tighter crop though!</td>', 'I can''t say I understand the topic of this.  Perhaps it is just a difference of opinions or interpretations of the challenge.  I like the composition of the photo though, the clouds are nicely achieved.  I would have liked to see a tighter crop though!', '2003-09-16 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(420246, 37450, 8816, '<td valign="top">I think your mistake on this one is not considering audience.  You''ve automatically narrowed your audience by including an american flag in the photo, as many of us (including me) do not view the american flag as a symbol of freedom.  I like the idea of the photo though!  The composition is simple and effective, would be nice to see the words straight though.</td>', 'I think your mistake on this one is not considering audience.  You''ve automatically narrowed your audience by including an american flag in the photo, as many of us (including me) do not view the american flag as a symbol of freedom.  I like the idea of the photo though!  The composition is simple and effective, would be nice to see the words straight though.', '2003-09-16 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(420247, 37397, 8816, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this photo.  I do like the composition, and gives me a feeling of freedom instead of just an understanding of your message.  Definite originality in this photo, and the emotional impact saves your score! 8</td>', 'I don''t understand this photo.  I do like the composition, and gives me a feeling of freedom instead of just an understanding of your message.  Definite originality in this photo, and the emotional impact saves your score! 8', '2003-09-16 00:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(420249, 37372, 8816, '<td valign="top">I highly disagree, and I think you forgot one key rule when choosing your subject matter, audience.  By choosing the american flag you automatically narrow your target audience, as many people do not view the american flag as a symbol of freedom!  On the other hand this photo is techniqually (bad spelling, I know) very strong, and depsite my obvious difference to the content, I do like your composition! 7</td>', 'I highly disagree, and I think you forgot one key rule when choosing your subject matter, audience.  By choosing the american flag you automatically narrow your target audience, as many people do not view the american flag as a symbol of freedom!  On the other hand this photo is techniqually (bad spelling, I know) very strong, and depsite my obvious difference to the content, I do like your composition! 7', '2003-09-16 00:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(420251, 37441, 8816, '<td valign="top">Despite me being against the whole american flag as a symbol of freedom thing, i love this photo!  It''s well executed and sends out a clear message!  I might liked to have seen the photo converted to black and white, while keeping the flag saturated, this might have made the flag even more prominent in the eye.  I''m gonna have to give you a 9 though, instead of a 10, just because of my difference to the american flag issue!</td>', 'Despite me being against the whole american flag as a symbol of freedom thing, i love this photo!  It''s well executed and sends out a clear message!  I might liked to have seen the photo converted to black and white, while keeping the flag saturated, this might have made the flag even more prominent in the eye.  I''m gonna have to give you a 9 though, instead of a 10, just because of my difference to the american flag issue!', '2003-09-16 00:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(420253, 37427, 8816, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what these names are.  Are they people who donated money to a landmark?  Members of the first ever Terry Fox run? or what?  I think more is needed in the photo to help it make sense.  I do like the composition with the man being viewed through the glass though! and the image is very sharp and clear!</td>', 'I''m not sure what these names are.  Are they people who donated money to a landmark?  Members of the first ever Terry Fox run? or what?  I think more is needed in the photo to help it make sense.  I do like the composition with the man being viewed through the glass though! and the image is very sharp and clear!', '2003-09-16 00:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(420254, 37384, 8816, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this photo.  It is so simple, yet so meaningful!  The age of the handcuffs help make it so effective, as well as the aged look of the flag.  Very nice, one of my fav''s of the challenge.  Would like to see it with a border, as it is such a tight crop! 9</td>', 'I love the composition of this photo.  It is so simple, yet so meaningful!  The age of the handcuffs help make it so effective, as well as the aged look of the flag.  Very nice, one of my fav''s of the challenge.  Would like to see it with a border, as it is such a tight crop! 9', '2003-09-16 01:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(420387, 37325, 11742, '<td valign="top">interesting concept -</td>', 'interesting concept -', '2003-09-16 05:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(420461, 37359, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition that says war and patriotism to me more than freedom. The lighting appears to be a little bright on the stripes.</td>', 'This is a good composition that says war and patriotism to me more than freedom. The lighting appears to be a little bright on the stripes.', '2003-09-16 10:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
