(420881, 37444, 11073, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.  I want to call it an abstract shot...but I don''t want to offend you if you don''t think it is...either way i like it alot.  I wish I''d see more shots like this than set up studio stuff.  The car (looks like a pontiac with those rims...) is a nice effecct.  Lends well to the statement that you''d be moving too...if you had the rest of the bike...at least that''s what i think your saying?  nice work.</td>', 'very cool shot.  I want to call it an abstract shot...but I don''t want to offend you if you don''t think it is...either way i like it alot.  I wish I''d see more shots like this than set up studio stuff.  The car (looks like a pontiac with those rims...) is a nice effecct.  Lends well to the statement that you''d be moving too...if you had the rest of the bike...at least that''s what i think your saying?  nice work.', '2003-09-16 21:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
