(420947, 37332, 2125, '<td valign="top">ha! no kidding! who needs a TV when you got DPC! 9</td>', 'ha! no kidding! who needs a TV when you got DPC! 9', '2003-09-16 22:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(420949, 37443, 2125, '<td valign="top">excellent focus clarity composition and dof  10</td>', 'excellent focus clarity composition and dof  10', '2003-09-16 22:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(420951, 37440, 2125, '<td valign="top">original I love it!! 9</td>', 'original I love it!! 9', '2003-09-16 22:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(421271, 37448, 9232, '<td valign="top">I see an artistic attempt.  The heart and wings are creative and the textured background works well with the basket''s frame and the smooth, featureless wings.  I don''t like the objects (straw, twigs, ???) at the bottom of the composition.  The lighting is good but without a little fill light from the left, the shadow of the basket wire obscures the left-most wing.</td>', 'I see an artistic attempt.  The heart and wings are creative and the textured background works well with the basket''s frame and the smooth, featureless wings.  I don''t like the objects (straw, twigs, ???) at the bottom of the composition.  The lighting is good but without a little fill light from the left, the shadow of the basket wire obscures the left-most wing.', '2003-09-17 03:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(421282, 37401, 4500, '<td valign="top">good title</td>', 'good title', '2003-09-17 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(421377, 37441, 8682, '<td valign="top">wow, wow...  i really love it... Good work... 9</td>', 'wow, wow...  i really love it... Good work... 9', '2003-09-17 07:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(421378, 37444, 8682, '<td valign="top">yeah, really fantastic shoot........ 9</td>', 'yeah, really fantastic shoot........ 9', '2003-09-17 07:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(421379, 37446, 8682, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, news are not freedom...</td>', 'Sometimes, news are not freedom...', '2003-09-17 07:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(421380, 37414, 8682, '<td valign="top">I agre... Love the composition...10</td>', 'I agre... Love the composition...10', '2003-09-17 07:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(421381, 37326, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful colours</td>', 'Beatiful colours', '2003-09-17 07:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(421384, 37352, 8682, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'Great interpretation of the challenge', '2003-09-17 07:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(421388, 37399, 8682, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, and the focus is good... Great contrast between blue and green... 9</td>', 'I love the composition, and the focus is good... Great contrast between blue and green... 9', '2003-09-17 07:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(421389, 37402, 8682, '<td valign="top">Good focus, and beatiful picture... 7</td>', 'Good focus, and beatiful picture... 7', '2003-09-17 07:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(421675, 37437, 11022, '<td valign="top">Wonderful representation of the idea.  Lovely photograph too.</td>', 'Wonderful representation of the idea.  Lovely photograph too.', '2003-09-17 12:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(421700, 37399, 6008, '<td valign="top">What I love most about this shot are the colors - they are so clean and vibrant. The lush grass and the wonderful sky almost makes you want to be in the picture, but then the actual topic of the shot brings it all back into perspective. That said, it does show a positive feeling and not a black and white, gloomy shot that is often associated with gravestones or cemeteries. Coupled with the challenge of freedom, I think showing this brighter side honors the memory of what these people fought and died for. Without their efforts we wouldnt have the lush grass and bright skies that sometimes we take for granted. I also really like the composition of this shot. There isnt really anything I would change. Great shot!</td>', 'What I love most about this shot are the colors - they are so clean and vibrant. The lush grass and the wonderful sky almost makes you want to be in the picture, but then the actual topic of the shot brings it all back into perspective. That said, it does show a positive feeling and not a black and white, gloomy shot that is often associated with gravestones or cemeteries. Coupled with the challenge of freedom, I think showing this brighter side honors the memory of what these people fought and died for. Without their efforts we wouldnt have the lush grass and bright skies that sometimes we take for granted. I also really like the composition of this shot. There isnt really anything I would change. Great shot!', '2003-09-17 12:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(421708, 37445, 6008, '<td valign="top">I find the message (or at least the one I envision I see) to be kinda interesting. Here we have a picture representing freedom and it''s in a cage! Of course the ''voice'' also seems to be a weapon, which I also find curious. This photograph makes some quite bold statements. That said, I do like the sepia tones, and although it may lack any ''wow'' factor, I think the message is what stands out from this photograph rather than being visually ''pretty''.</td>', 'I find the message (or at least the one I envision I see) to be kinda interesting. Here we have a picture representing freedom and it''s in a cage! Of course the ''voice'' also seems to be a weapon, which I also find curious. This photograph makes some quite bold statements. That said, I do like the sepia tones, and although it may lack any ''wow'' factor, I think the message is what stands out from this photograph rather than being visually ''pretty''.', '2003-09-17 12:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(422055, 37406, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting...Where''d you find THIS situation???</td>', 'Interesting...Where''d you find THIS situation???', '2003-09-17 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(422057, 37397, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!!!  Very emotive.  Don''t know how it fits challenge but I''m still giving it an 8!</td>', 'Very cool shot!!!  Very emotive.  Don''t know how it fits challenge but I''m still giving it an 8!', '2003-09-17 16:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(422060, 37428, 9906, '<td valign="top">Focus is off.  How did you get this effect?</td>', 'Focus is off.  How did you get this effect?', '2003-09-17 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(422061, 37422, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The soft focus on the hands takes the attention where it belongs.  I would like to see a slightly sharper focus on the cross.  8 and I may change it up after looking at rest!</td>', 'Very nice.  The soft focus on the hands takes the attention where it belongs.  I would like to see a slightly sharper focus on the cross.  8 and I may change it up after looking at rest!', '2003-09-17 16:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(422062, 37459, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cool. How may ticks on the bottom of the zippo???</td>', 'Cool. How may ticks on the bottom of the zippo???', '2003-09-17 16:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(422066, 37456, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I would increase the DOF a touch so that words in crease were more in focus.  Very in sinc with the theme!!!  And the text matches the title.  Bonus point!</td>', 'Very nice.  I would increase the DOF a touch so that words in crease were more in focus.  Very in sinc with the theme!!!  And the text matches the title.  Bonus point!', '2003-09-17 16:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(422069, 37332, 9906, '<td valign="top">I woulda called it "Freedom TO think".  Wonder if any one else will get it.  Bonus points for originality!</td>', 'I woulda called it "Freedom TO think".  Wonder if any one else will get it.  Bonus points for originality!', '2003-09-17 16:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(422075, 37342, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the title but love the shot.  The title implies that you have to choose between the flag and the church and I don''t see that to be the case.  DOF is good but focus is a touch (take your pick) sharp or soft for moods I would try to read into this shot.</td>', 'I don''t like the title but love the shot.  The title implies that you have to choose between the flag and the church and I don''t see that to be the case.  DOF is good but focus is a touch (take your pick) sharp or soft for moods I would try to read into this shot.', '2003-09-17 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(422080, 37340, 9906, '<td valign="top">Is this an actual write in ballot???  Will you actually be able to vote???  Where''s Arnold???  Who''s gonna be pissed from the phone number on the pen???  Lot''s of questions.<br/>Dead on focus.  Maybe a touch over sharpened.  Great shot.  One of my faves so far!  8</td>', 'Is this an actual write in ballot???  Will you actually be able to vote???  Where''s Arnold???  Who''s gonna be pissed from the phone number on the pen???  Lot''s of questions.Dead on focus.  Maybe a touch over sharpened.  Great shot.  One of my faves so far!  8', '2003-09-17 16:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(422093, 37441, 778, '<td valign="top">Best of the bunch!  Chrisp, well thought out, nice reflection.  Only suggestion would be to try to reduce the window light on the right side of the eye!  Great Job! 10</td>', 'Best of the bunch!  Chrisp, well thought out, nice reflection.  Only suggestion would be to try to reduce the window light on the right side of the eye!  Great Job! 10', '2003-09-17 17:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(422095, 37400, 778, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great focus!  Subject matter open the mind to something other than the norm! A solid 9 from me!  Good work!</td>', 'Nice shot, great focus!  Subject matter open the mind to something other than the norm! A solid 9 from me!  Good work!', '2003-09-17 17:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(422174, 37401, 8860, '<td valign="top">Impressive subject. Not my idea of freedom (apart from the cliche of the flag) and I''m not sure if these tanks represent anything. At least they felt freedom enough to paint them though! <br/> <br/>I would have straightened the shot on the verticals rather than bottom line as it looks tilted, and focus is a little soft.</td>', 'Impressive subject. Not my idea of freedom (apart from the cliche of the flag) and I''m not sure if these tanks represent anything. At least they felt freedom enough to paint them though!  I would have straightened the shot on the verticals rather than bottom line as it looks tilted, and focus is a little soft.', '2003-09-17 18:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(422180, 37406, 8860, '<td valign="top">This represents anything but freedom for cows and chickens though. Just depends how you look at things! I''m not sure why you didn''t straighten the shot to the line of the flagpole? Good colour.</td>', 'This represents anything but freedom for cows and chickens though. Just depends how you look at things! I''m not sure why you didn''t straighten the shot to the line of the flagpole? Good colour.', '2003-09-17 18:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(422183, 37432, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shot could have been straightened, but I like the idea and composition.</td>', 'Shot could have been straightened, but I like the idea and composition.', '2003-09-17 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(422187, 37403, 8860, '<td valign="top">Absolutely. Do you think they''d be proud of what they fought for?</td>', 'Absolutely. Do you think they''d be proud of what they fought for?', '2003-09-17 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(422536, 37376, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. It really makes the guy pop out of the picture. I don''t like the tinting too much. I think a straight b&amp;w shot would have given it more of an impact. I see some really nice shadows and with b&amp;w they would really shine.</td>', 'Great lighting. It really makes the guy pop out of the picture. I don''t like the tinting too much. I think a straight b&w shot would have given it more of an impact. I see some really nice shadows and with b&w they would really shine.', '2003-09-17 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(422539, 37424, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very original idea. I can see people putting this shot up at work. Interesting use of negative. It brings the focus to the watch. The frame works with this piece. It adds a depth to the picture. Great work.</td>', 'Very original idea. I can see people putting this shot up at work. Interesting use of negative. It brings the focus to the watch. The frame works with this piece. It adds a depth to the picture. Great work.', '2003-09-17 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(422543, 37358, 10084, '<td valign="top">Intersting shot. I like how this shot has many layers. The wall, landscape, hills, and the sky. The bold colors of the flag brings it great attention. The wall also leads your eyes from the left side of the picture toward the right where the flag is. Great composition.</td>', 'Intersting shot. I like how this shot has many layers. The wall, landscape, hills, and the sky. The bold colors of the flag brings it great attention. The wall also leads your eyes from the left side of the picture toward the right where the flag is. Great composition.', '2003-09-17 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(422545, 37428, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like a watercolor painting. The bold colors in the flags really make them pop out of the darker background. The multiply flags gives it more interest.</td>', 'Looks almost like a watercolor painting. The bold colors in the flags really make them pop out of the darker background. The multiply flags gives it more interest.', '2003-09-17 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(422548, 37455, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looking straight at the monument isn''t interesting enough. Try getting a different view. Like a side shot would give the piece more interest. <br/> <br/>Getting in closer would give you some shadows in the lettering and make the viewer feel the texture of the monument. Some really nice pictures of monuments gets in really close and you can see the rought spot of the stone and makes you almost feel it.</td>', 'Looking straight at the monument isn''t interesting enough. Try getting a different view. Like a side shot would give the piece more interest.  Getting in closer would give you some shadows in the lettering and make the viewer feel the texture of the monument. Some really nice pictures of monuments gets in really close and you can see the rought spot of the stone and makes you almost feel it.', '2003-09-17 23:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(422551, 37372, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The rich bold colors make the image of the flag pop out. A lot of color also makes it busy. Putting a white frame may make the image pop out even more. Great subject.</td>', 'Nice composition. The rich bold colors make the image of the flag pop out. A lot of color also makes it busy. Putting a white frame may make the image pop out even more. Great subject.', '2003-09-17 23:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(422574, 37423, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors really make this a great composition. Good details in the hair. Very dynamic picture. It shows a lot of movement.</td>', 'Beautiful colors really make this a great composition. Good details in the hair. Very dynamic picture. It shows a lot of movement.', '2003-09-18 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(422578, 37400, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very this macro of the water droplet. The green background really helps to bring that forward. Wished that the fabric in the flag was brighter. I like how you can see light through the fabric. It gives the flag a feeling of texture.</td>', 'Very this macro of the water droplet. The green background really helps to bring that forward. Wished that the fabric in the flag was brighter. I like how you can see light through the fabric. It gives the flag a feeling of texture.', '2003-09-18 00:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(422581, 37332, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great focus in this shot. The great contrast really adds to the shot. Every item seem to pop out of the picture. Good shadows in the piece helps with this. You can get the feeling of texture in everything . From the pebbles to the backwall. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Great focus in this shot. The great contrast really adds to the shot. Every item seem to pop out of the picture. Good shadows in the piece helps with this. You can get the feeling of texture in everything . From the pebbles to the backwall. Beautiful shot.', '2003-09-18 00:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(422696, 37399, 4090, '<td valign="top">hi Have been back to this photo a few times now. love how it is all in focus, the colour is great, compostion is just perfect so there is only one score for this 10/10 hope to see it with a ribbon - Good luck Tony</td>', 'hi Have been back to this photo a few times now. love how it is all in focus, the colour is great, compostion is just perfect so there is only one score for this 10/10 hope to see it with a ribbon - Good luck Tony', '2003-09-18 03:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(422699, 37441, 4090, '<td valign="top">Beauiful Eye , and the focus is fab 10/10 (only gave 3 tens and this is one of them)<br/>Good luck - Tony</td>', 'Beauiful Eye , and the focus is fab 10/10 (only gave 3 tens and this is one of them)Good luck - Tony', '2003-09-18 03:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(422701, 37427, 4090, '<td valign="top">great photo - 10/10 (love the effect and the blue of the sky)</td>', 'great photo - 10/10 (love the effect and the blue of the sky)', '2003-09-18 03:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(422865, 37376, 12321, '<td valign="top">subject matter makes a great statement that needs to be heard. the expression on this vet''s face is priceless. add the flag in the pocket and  WOW!.....intense.!!! this pic reminds me of the photographic genius of diane arbus. technical issues are not everything in the world of photography.</td>', 'subject matter makes a great statement that needs to be heard. the expression on this vet''s face is priceless. add the flag in the pocket and  WOW!.....intense.!!! this pic reminds me of the photographic genius of diane arbus. technical issues are not everything in the world of photography.', '2003-09-18 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(422866, 37448, 12321, '<td valign="top">great lighting, color and comp. hovever, the heart jsut ruins it for me.</td>', 'great lighting, color and comp. hovever, the heart jsut ruins it for me.', '2003-09-18 10:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(422867, 37352, 12321, '<td valign="top">interesting..... color seems a bit off. i wish the hasp of the lock was pulled forward more. right now it is getting visually lost in the puddle in the background.</td>', 'interesting..... color seems a bit off. i wish the hasp of the lock was pulled forward more. right now it is getting visually lost in the puddle in the background.', '2003-09-18 10:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(422956, 37401, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot.  Love the colors and the focus is great!  Where is this??? 8</td>', 'This is a really cool shot.  Love the colors and the focus is great!  Where is this??? 8', '2003-09-18 12:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(422958, 37445, 9906, '<td valign="top">The part of the cage closest to the camera is VERY distractiong to the overall effect.  Love the use of the sepia here.</td>', 'The part of the cage closest to the camera is VERY distractiong to the overall effect.  Love the use of the sepia here.', '2003-09-18 12:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(422959, 37372, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  I think you need more focus though and the lighting could be better (IHMO bottom left stars need more light)!</td>', 'Interesting composition.  I think you need more focus though and the lighting could be better (IHMO bottom left stars need more light)!', '2003-09-18 12:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(422961, 37358, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful scene here.  Glad to see other countries associating their flags with ''freedom''!  Personally I think I would have cropped out the sidewalk.  IMHO there is too much of the front wall.  Oh and I don''t know if this is an American asthetics thing but I probably would have flipped the shot so the flag was flying to the right instead of flying to the left...to ME it looks backwards.  Overall 7</td>', 'Very beautiful scene here.  Glad to see other countries associating their flags with ''freedom''!  Personally I think I would have cropped out the sidewalk.  IMHO there is too much of the front wall.  Oh and I don''t know if this is an American asthetics thing but I probably would have flipped the shot so the flag was flying to the right instead of flying to the left...to ME it looks backwards.  Overall 7', '2003-09-18 12:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(422966, 37427, 9906, '<td valign="top">What monument is this???  I don''t believe it''s Vietnam Vets Memorial in DC,or  is it??.  You did a good job of capturing the viewers reflection.  Was this person with you?  My first impression of him was that he was kinda disrespectful (didn''t remove his hat!).  Nice shot overall.  Glad you kept the color.</td>', 'What monument is this???  I don''t believe it''s Vietnam Vets Memorial in DC,or  is it??.  You did a good job of capturing the viewers reflection.  Was this person with you?  My first impression of him was that he was kinda disrespectful (didn''t remove his hat!).  Nice shot overall.  Glad you kept the color.', '2003-09-18 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(422969, 37435, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Would never have thought of this.  The button might be overkill though, but it definately defines the purpose of the shot.  Great focus and neat colors!  8</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Would never have thought of this.  The button might be overkill though, but it definately defines the purpose of the shot.  Great focus and neat colors!  8', '2003-09-18 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(423041, 37432, 12319, '<td valign="top">Unlike most of the others, so far, on subject, good light and relatively good composition.</td>', 'Unlike most of the others, so far, on subject, good light and relatively good composition.', '2003-09-18 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(423042, 37410, 12319, '<td valign="top">On subject, I like chrome in photos.</td>', 'On subject, I like chrome in photos.', '2003-09-18 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(423043, 37325, 12319, '<td valign="top">Off subject, seen many times before, with different colours.</td>', 'Off subject, seen many times before, with different colours.', '2003-09-18 13:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(423044, 37454, 12319, '<td valign="top">Not sure whats going on here, doesn''t accomplish anything.</td>', 'Not sure whats going on here, doesn''t accomplish anything.', '2003-09-18 13:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(423050, 37397, 12319, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I think that the image should say freedom without having to think much about it.</td>', 'Nice image, but I think that the image should say freedom without having to think much about it.', '2003-09-18 13:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(423051, 37423, 12319, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I think that the image should say freedom without having to think much about it.</td>', 'Nice image, but I think that the image should say freedom without having to think much about it.', '2003-09-18 13:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(423053, 37347, 12319, '<td valign="top">On subject, excellent composition</td>', 'On subject, excellent composition', '2003-09-18 13:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(423056, 37441, 12319, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, how come there is no reflection on the pupil? Off subject.</td>', 'Excellent image, how come there is no reflection on the pupil? Off subject.', '2003-09-18 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(423075, 37378, 8860, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit dull. It would have created more atmosphere to have offset the light to the bottom right. I feel stupid here, but the message behind it has evaded me! Perhaps you can ''enlighten'' me? I''ll get my coat! ;)</td>', 'The composition is a bit dull. It would have created more atmosphere to have offset the light to the bottom right. I feel stupid here, but the message behind it has evaded me! Perhaps you can ''enlighten'' me? I''ll get my coat! ;)', '2003-09-18 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(423078, 37455, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very true.</td>', 'Very true.', '2003-09-18 14:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(423360, 37459, 9932, '<td valign="top">A little more light on the lighter may have helped</td>', 'A little more light on the lighter may have helped', '2003-09-18 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(423385, 37344, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, not much to say I think it says it all</td>', 'Nice shot, not much to say I think it says it all', '2003-09-18 18:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(423436, 37393, 7969, '<td valign="top">The way the light is hitting this is very lovely.  Well done.</td>', 'The way the light is hitting this is very lovely.  Well done.', '2003-09-18 18:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(423438, 37454, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like your ''statement'', and while i see why needed to be ''faded'' I wish was little less so was more visible image, still one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'I like your ''statement'', and while i see why needed to be ''faded'' I wish was little less so was more visible image, still one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2003-09-18 18:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(423440, 37432, 7969, '<td valign="top">I dont think this is the most technically stunning shot, but it is at least a creative and different approach to this challenge, and I like it, nice work</td>', 'I dont think this is the most technically stunning shot, but it is at least a creative and different approach to this challenge, and I like it, nice work', '2003-09-18 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
