(423785, 37428, 7706, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you are happy or disappointed with the score, but I am glad you shot for you, and did what you wanted to do with this image. Its fine to shoot nice images and all but only ever shoot things that make you happy. The effect gives a blurry look, but as your title suggests, so do tears. Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-19 02:17:11.</i></td>', 'Don''t know if you are happy or disappointed with the score, but I am glad you shot for you, and did what you wanted to do with this image. Its fine to shoot nice images and all but only ever shoot things that make you happy. The effect gives a blurry look, but as your title suggests, so do tears. Good job!', '2003-09-19 03:15:18.000000', '2003-09-19 03:17:11.000000', 0),
