(423883, 37339, 1031, '<td valign="top">There is a scene in the movie <i>Toy Story</i> which almost exactly follows this theme; Woody sees that Syd (their tormentor) has left the door ajar a crack and shouts "Buzz [Lightyear]! The Door! We''re Free!"<br/> <br/>Shooting a jail cell door ajar might make the interpretation more obvious, but your use of grainy darkness accomplishes much the same purpose. Well done!</td>', 'There is a scene in the movie Toy Story which almost exactly follows this theme; Woody sees that Syd (their tormentor) has left the door ajar a crack and shouts "Buzz [Lightyear]! The Door! We''re Free!" Shooting a jail cell door ajar might make the interpretation more obvious, but your use of grainy darkness accomplishes much the same purpose. Well done!', '2003-09-19 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(423884, 37441, 8125, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the win - I''m going to experiment now that I see how you did it.  Truly a great photo.  Nice work.  :-)</td>', 'Congrats on the win - I''m going to experiment now that I see how you did it.  Truly a great photo.  Nice work.  :-)', '2003-09-19 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(423891, 37423, 5982, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented and mostly loved this shot.  This is my son facing a fan and throwing his head to the back when I shoot the photo.  I then just tweak the colors with hue/saturation, many times to get the right colors.  I''m not from the US but I thought it would mean freedom to Americans in the late circumstances.</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented and mostly loved this shot.  This is my son facing a fan and throwing his head to the back when I shoot the photo.  I then just tweak the colors with hue/saturation, many times to get the right colors.  I''m not from the US but I thought it would mean freedom to Americans in the late circumstances.', '2003-09-19 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(423892, 37454, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good entry.  I like the ghost effect, and the "message" of the picture.  IMHO this should have ended up higher (but then, I''m probably letting my bias show - and as a former seamstress, I should know better than letting my bias show).<br/></td>', 'Good entry.  I like the ghost effect, and the "message" of the picture.  IMHO this should have ended up higher (but then, I''m probably letting my bias show - and as a former seamstress, I should know better than letting my bias show).', '2003-09-19 12:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
