(424182, 37323, 3554, '<td valign="top">One of the things I love about this shot is the contrast of his young face and his old hands. His hands look like those of a warrior while if you just look at his face you expect him to be in a school baseball uniform more than fatigues.</td>', 'One of the things I love about this shot is the contrast of his young face and his old hands. His hands look like those of a warrior while if you just look at his face you expect him to be in a school baseball uniform more than fatigues.', '2003-09-19 16:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
