(424625, 37393, 6624, '<td valign="top">In case anyone is still wondering:  I didn''t want to shoot flags (patriotism not freedom)  or any other war/death related items.  I feel that freedom (just as life) is about freedom to grow, to move on, to make use of history...so, a milkweed seed breaking loose from the pod seemed to make sense on many levels.</td>', 'In case anyone is still wondering:  I didn''t want to shoot flags (patriotism not freedom)  or any other war/death related items.  I feel that freedom (just as life) is about freedom to grow, to move on, to make use of history...so, a milkweed seed breaking loose from the pod seemed to make sense on many levels.', '2003-09-20 10:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
