(424896, 37384, 4625, '<td valign="top">Selecting a different white balance on the camera would make the white look a lot whiter. On the G2 it''s the button on the back next to the LCD that has WB, and a few icons next to it. Play with those settings a bit to get a feel for what it changes.</td>', 'Selecting a different white balance on the camera would make the white look a lot whiter. On the G2 it''s the button on the back next to the LCD that has WB, and a few icons next to it. Play with those settings a bit to get a feel for what it changes.', '2003-09-21 01:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(425124, 37399, 2906, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2003-09-21 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(426945, 37323, 10060, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. In addition to the things that others have been saying, I think it illustrates that the stereotypical notion of muscle-bound Rambos is nonsense and that freedom requires a contribution from everyone. <br/></td>', 'I love this photo. In addition to the things that others have been saying, I think it illustrates that the stereotypical notion of muscle-bound Rambos is nonsense and that freedom requires a contribution from everyone. ', '2003-09-23 03:12:39.000000', NULL, 0),
