(427043, 37441, 2609, '<td valign="top">I don''t disagree that it''s a fine photo, but looking at the rest there was some more original images that could have ranked higher.  I feel that the whole eye thing is overdone and the whole flag thing in the eye is a classic in its own right.  However, your execution is flawless and it truly deserves to be noticed.</td>', 'I don''t disagree that it''s a fine photo, but looking at the rest there was some more original images that could have ranked higher.  I feel that the whole eye thing is overdone and the whole flag thing in the eye is a classic in its own right.  However, your execution is flawless and it truly deserves to be noticed.', '2003-09-23 10:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
